{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 12:42-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.AUTO-LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["fi"],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Jos arvo on valittu, aloita uuden arvon kirjoittaminen tyhjent\u00e4\u00e4ksesi edellisen arvon."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Kun numero on valittu (arvo n\u00e4kyy k\u00e4\u00e4nteisen\u00e4), voit poistaa valinnan oikealla nuolin\u00e4pp\u00e4imell\u00e4 tyhjent\u00e4m\u00e4tt\u00e4 arvoa. Muokkaa sitten askelpalauttimella."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["VINKKI: Yleens\u00e4 on parasta k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 TAB- tai SHIFT-TAB-n\u00e4pp\u00e4imi\u00e4 siirty\u00e4ksesi yhdest\u00e4 sy\u00f6tteest\u00e4 seuraavaan tai edelliseen sy\u00f6tteeseen."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["VINKKI 2: Yleens\u00e4 arvon muokkaaminen on tehotonta. Koska arvot valitaan automaattisesti, kirjoita vain haluamasi luku."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["\u00c4l\u00e4 kirjoita tuhaterotusmerkki\u00e4."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Jos k\u00e4yt\u00f6ss\u00e4 on Yhdysvaltojen konventio, se olisi pilkku.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Olen tarpeeksi fiksu sy\u00f6tt\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4n ne puolestasi!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Tapahtui tuntematon p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4n laskentavirhe."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Ilmoita meille sy\u00f6tteesi ja asetuksesi, jotta voimme korjata t\u00e4m\u00e4n. Kiitos."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["P\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4 ei ole kelvollinen - virheellinen vuosi."],"Jan":["tammi"],"Feb":["helmi"],"Mar":["maalis"],"Apr":["huhti"],"May":["toukokuu"],"Jun":["kes\u00e4"],"Jul":["hein\u00e4"],"Aug":["elo"],"Sept":["syys"],"Oct":["loka"],"Nov":["marras"],"Dec":["joulu"],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Virhe: p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4t eiv\u00e4t ole j\u00e4rjestyksess\u00e4."],"Exception":["Poikkeus"],"occurred when accessing":["tapahtui, kun k\u00e4ytettiin"],"Invalid index":["Virheellinen indeksi"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["Sis\u00e4inen raja saavutettu. Saldo ylitt\u00e4\u00e4 +\/- 99 biljoonaa."],"YTD":["KHT"],"Running Totals":["Juoksevat summat"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["Henkil\u00f6kohtainen lainaaikataulusi"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["Viimeisen maksuer\u00e4n summaa v\u00e4hennettiin"],"due to rounding":["py\u00f6rist\u00e4misest\u00e4 johtuen"],"Last payment amount increased by":["Viimeisen maksun summa kasvoi"],"Auto Loan Summary":["Autolainan yhteenveto"],"Down Payment":["K\u00e4siraha"],"Loan Amount":["Lainasumma"],"Number of Payments":["Maksujen lukum\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4"],"Annual Interest Rate":["Vuotuinen korkoprosentti"],"Periodic Payment":["Jaksottainen maksu"],"Loan Date":["Lainan p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4"],"1st Payment Due":["Ensimm\u00e4inen maksup\u00e4iv\u00e4"],"Payment Frequency":["Maksutiheys"],"Last Payment Due":["Viimeinen maksup\u00e4iv\u00e4"],"Total Interest Due":["Korkojen kokonaism\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4"],"Total All Payments":["Kaikki maksut yhteens\u00e4"],"Auto Loan Payment Schedule":["Autolainan maksuaikataulu"],"Year":["Vuosi"],"Date":["P\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4"],"Payment":["Maksu"],"Interest":["Korko"],"Principal":["P\u00e4\u00e4oma"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Calculation method: Normal":["Laskentamenetelm\u00e4: Normaali"],"Total Principal":["Kokonaisp\u00e4\u00e4oma"],"Total Interest":["Kokonaiskorko"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["Kokonaismaksujen %"],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["Vuotuiset p\u00e4\u00e4oma- ja korkosummat"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Kertyneet p\u00e4\u00e4oma- ja korkosummat sek\u00e4 j\u00e4ljell\u00e4 oleva saldo"],"Total Principal and Interest":["Kokonaisp\u00e4\u00e4oma ja korko"],"Loan":["Laina"],"One of the following: \"Price\", \"Down Payment Amount\" or \"Loan Amount\" must be \"0\".":["Yhden seuraavista: \"Hinta\", \"K\u00e4sirahan summa\" tai \"Lainasumma\" on oltava \"0\"."],"You may use our general purpose loan calculator if you don't want to consider purchase price.":["Voit k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 yleisk\u00e4ytt\u00f6ist\u00e4 lainalaskuriamme, jos et halua ottaa huomioon ostohintaa."],"Only one of the following: \"Price\", \"Down Payment\" or \"Loan Amount\" can be \"0\".":["Vain yksi seuraavista: \"Hinta\", \"K\u00e4siraha\" tai \"Lainasumma\" voi olla \"0\"."],"There are too many unknown values.":["Tuntemattomia arvoja on liikaa."],"Auto Loan Calculator Help":["Autolainalaskuri ohje"],"<p>Use this calculator to calculate loan details when the down payment is expressed as an amount.<\/p>":["<p>K\u00e4yt\u00e4 t\u00e4t\u00e4 laskuria lainatietojen laskemiseen, kun k\u00e4siraha on ilmaistu summana.<\/p>"],"<p>Unlike a general loan calculator, this calculator allows for two unknown values. In addition to solving for the monthly payment amount, it will also calculate the \"Car Price\", the \"Down Payment Amount\" or the \"Loan Amount\". Just enter a \"0\" (zero) for one of the three values and provide the other two.<\/p>":["<p>Toisin kuin yleinen lainalaskuri, t\u00e4m\u00e4 laskuri mahdollistaa kahden tuntemattoman arvon laskemisen. Kuukausimaksun lis\u00e4ksi se laskee my\u00f6s \"Auton hinnan\", \"K\u00e4sirahan summan\" tai \"Lainasumman\". Sy\u00f6t\u00e4 vain \"0\" (nolla) yhdelle kolmesta arvosta ja anna kaksi muuta.<\/p>"],"<p>Note that the calculator calculates what percentage the down payment is of the price of the car. This is handy when a lender requires a borrower to provide a minimum percentage cash deposit.<\/p>":["<p>Huomaa, ett\u00e4 laskuri laskee, kuinka suuri prosenttiosuus k\u00e4siraha on auton hinnasta. T\u00e4m\u00e4 on k\u00e4tev\u00e4\u00e4, kun lainanantaja vaatii v\u00e4himm\u00e4isk\u00e4sirahan prosenttiosuutta.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">Lainan kesto ilmoitetaan kuukausien lukum\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4n\u00e4.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 kuukautta = &nbsp;5 vuotta<\/li><li>120 kuukautta = 10 vuotta<\/li><li>180 kuukautta = 15 vuotta<\/li><li>240 kuukautta = 20 vuotta<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 kuukautta = 30 vuotta<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need the ability to print the amortization schedule, or more flexibility such as selecting different payment or compounding frequencies or the ability to calculate term or interest rate, please see the auto loan calculator here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Jos tarvitset mahdollisuuden tulostaa lyhennysohjelman tai enemm\u00e4n joustavuutta, kuten eri maksutahtien tai korkojaksojen valinnan tai mahdollisuuden laskea laina-aikaa tai korkoprosenttia, katso autolainalaskuri t\u00e4\u00e4ll\u00e4: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you want to set the loan closing date and first payment due date; select different payment or compounding frequencies; the ability to calculate term or interest rate; or the ability to export the schedule to Excel or Word, please see the auto loan calculator here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Jos haluat asettaa lainan p\u00e4\u00e4ttymisp\u00e4iv\u00e4n ja ensimm\u00e4isen maksun er\u00e4p\u00e4iv\u00e4n; valita eri maksutiheyksi\u00e4 tai korkojaksojen tiheyksi\u00e4; laskea laina-aika tai korkoprosentti; tai vied\u00e4 aikataulun Exceliin tai Wordiin, katso autolainalaskuri t\u00e4\u00e4lt\u00e4: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Monthly":["Kuukausittainen"],"Your Personalized Car Loan Schedule":["Henkil\u00f6kohtainen autolainan maksuaikataulu"],"Prepared for":["Kenelle valmistettu"],"Address":["Osoite"],"City, State  ZIP":["Kaupunki, Maakunta  Postinumero"],"Prepared On":["Laadittu"],"Prepared by":["Valmistajan nimi"],"Phone":["Puhelin"],"Email":["S\u00e4hk\u00f6posti"],"Website":["Verkkosivusto"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["K\u00e4yt\u00e4 backspace-n\u00e4pp\u00e4int\u00e4 poistaaksesi."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Vasen, yl\u00f6s- ja alanuolin\u00e4pp\u00e4imet ovat pois k\u00e4yt\u00f6st\u00e4. Sama koskee home, end, pgup ja pgdn -n\u00e4pp\u00e4imi\u00e4."],"Use backspace to delete.":["K\u00e4yt\u00e4 backspace-n\u00e4pp\u00e4int\u00e4 poistaaksesi."],"Unknown":["Tuntematon"],"u":["t"],"U":["T"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["P\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4rien on oltava kuukauden ensimm\u00e4isi\u00e4 p\u00e4ivi\u00e4."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Virheellinen JavaScript-p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4objekti."]}}}